ng","comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-21T12:04:34Z"},{"number":486,"title":"errors after startup windynamic desktop","comments":4,"created_at":"2022-10-05T14:11:26Z"},{"number":659,"title":"WinDD Error when opening - logfile could not be opened","comments":3,"created_at":"2025-09-10T12:22:44Z"},{"number":259,"title":"Stretching theme window stretches the image preview also","comments":3,"created_at":"2020-10-18T05:01:52Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":671,"title":"WinDynamicDesktop 5.7.0-beta.1","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2025-11-18T02:42:59Z"},{"number":660,"title":"Natively support HEIC MacOS wallpapers","comments":1,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2025-09-14T17:05:28Z"},{"number":644,"title":"My custom .ddw files refuse to work.","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2025-04-28T22:18:56Z"},{"number":647,"title":"Spanning wallpaper across multiple monitors is not centered vertically","comments":3,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2025-04-23T03:14:55Z"},{"number":642,"title":"v. 5.6.1 throwing random \"Class not registered\" errors","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2025-04-03T20:32:07Z"},{"number":637,"title":"Release a version for linux","comments":3,"category":"General","created_at":"2025-01-31T06:51:44Z"},{"number":624,"title":"Upgrade win 11 24H2","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2024-11-27T22:43:28Z"},{"number":623,"title":"Theme Wallpaper Settings/Customization (Desktop Fit and Timings)","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2024-11-23T15:31:08Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"WinDynamicDesktop 5.7.0","tag":"v5.7.0","published_at":"2026-06-16T12:49:42Z","body":"# Enhancements\r\n\r\n* Added Tahoe Abstract and Golden Gate Abstract themes\r\n* Updated to .NET 10 which enables dark mode across entire application ([#553](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/553))\r\n* Rewrote theme preview renderer to be more lightweight by using Skia framework ([#672](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/pull/672))\r\n* Added Lithuanian translation (thanks Matas)\r\n\r\n# Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* Reduced impact on Windows startup time ([#645](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/645))\r\n* Fixed error when applying \"None\" wallpaper theme ([#652](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/652))\r\n* Fixed wallpaper not always refreshing when PC resumes from sleep ([#657](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/657))\r\n* Fixed `COMException` that could happen when PC resumes from sleep ([#680](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/680))\r\n* Fixed `IndexOutOfRangeException` that could occur when wallpaper changes at night in locations that don't get dark ([#686](https://github.com/t1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop/issues/686))","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}